'''Ghost Sea''' (絶滅海洋タウン ''Zetsumetsu Kaiyō Taun'', '''Extinct Sea Town''') is the 13th sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 62nd sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
[[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Aliens]]' strength magnifications are further increased from this sub-chapter onward, therefore the player will need to have all [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]] from all three [[Cats of the Cosmos]] chapters, especially for 2,500% [[Star Peng]]s and 1,000% [[Mesocosmocyclone]]s. Otherwise, this sub-chapter is fairly straightforward; the hardest stages are probably [[Iwa Rock Reef]] and [[Nautilus Tomb]].
{{LegendDiff|140|180|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces no new enemies, however, the [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Aliens]] from [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 3 appear in Legend Stages for the first time in this sub-chapter.
*[[Gardeneel Bros.]]: A long-ranged Starred Alien enemy. They have low overall stats but stand at 1,800 range and have a 100% chance to warp Cat Units forward, which can teleport groups of backliners and attackers directly into the line of fire.
*[[Mesocosmocyclone]]: A smaller version of [[Super Cosmic Cyclone]], it has shorter range and warps cats forward 150 range for 100f. Don't underestimate it, because without debuffers or [[:Category:Cats with Warp Immunity|Cats with Warp Immunity]], it'll push incredibly quickly.
*[[Axoloty]]: A lethal Starred Alien enemy, he has surprisingly high range (450), deals upwards of 400k damage in Uncanny Legends and has a guaranteed chance to create a 10 [[Wave Attack]]. However, he does have a somewhat long foreswing, a weak Barrier, and his backswing lasts for more than 4 minutes, usually preventing him from attacking more than once at every stagger threshold.

